  // design: Flavius Rule's octagon (docs/map-briefs/sandfall_colosseum/OCTAGON_PLAN.md): made by tools/content/kit/arenaCorner.mjs. The anchor cell is the corner of the sand (the tile covers the cells 0..8 east and north of it). The rows are the Seating Tier's (0.5 m by 1 m) and the podium Arena Seating's, so they meet the straight bays flush; seats in the solids slot, lips in trim, walls and vaults in walls, walkways and slabs in floor. Arches collide plain (piers and lintel; owner 2026-11-14, 6a). The gate option (phase 3, MapMaker's tile inspector: a tile of its own, so maps need no new field): the walk and the roof open into the gatehouse tower (core.arena_corner_tower) over the facade's middle three bays: no windows or parapet there.
